{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亞運壁球混雙決賽，鄧銘漮及李嘉兒擊敗隊友奪金。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>港隊歷史性包辦決賽席位，紅衫的鄧銘漮及李嘉兒用21分鐘，以11-8及11-3，直落擊敗黎卓楠及謝依霖，奪得金牌及賽馬會200萬元獎金。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.SQUASH-1600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026c2RHPSfQc71790499824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.SQUASH-1600_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上屆混雙奪銅的李嘉兒，繼2018年女團後，再上頒獎台最高一級。鄧銘漮首奪亞運金牌。黎卓楠及謝依霖的銀牌同屬生涯首面亞運獎牌，獎金100萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T09:38:20.527332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}